// spec/settlement/directBounty.md, "A standard award freezes its network, asset and two split amounts"; spec/settlement/directBounty.md, "Each finalized transaction belongs to one ledger and one exact request"; spec/settlement/payment.md, "A destination requires the current account and wallet consent"; spec/settlement/payment.md, "Private fee schedules are exact and purpose-bound"
